  "title": "Jamaican Brown Stew Chicken",
  "description": "Make this tender brown stew chicken full of sweet, savory, and spicy Caribbean flavors with Chef John&#39;s recipe for the famous Jamaican stew.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-09-29T17:40:41-04:00",
